d to Belfast English and sociolinguistic research.\",\"docName\":\"Belfast-English\",\"editTime\":\"2025-11-10T14:58:22.145\",\"fileName\":\"Belfast-English.docx\",\"folder\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\XiaoXinPro 16 IAH\\\\Desktop\\\\LRIA_llm_eval\\\\eval\\\\Quantum_e2e_v20251106\\\\Bvt1110\\\\bvtfiles\",\"id\":1987776371828592640,\"isDeleted\":0,\"isTmpFile\":false,\"labelNameList\":[\"History\",\"Data Analysis\",\"Research Paper\"],\"lastModifyTime\":\"2025-09-17T09:45:00\",\"md5\":\"3193e699ffa92db332ae31a9fb1d3cb4\",\"path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\XiaoXinPro 16 IAH\\\\Desktop\\\\LRIA_llm_eval\\\\eval\\\\Quantum_e2e_v20251106\\\\Bvt1110\\\\bvtfiles\\\\Belfast-English.docx\",\"previewPath\":\"c:\\\\users\\\\xiaoxinpro 16 iah\\\\documents\\\\qtcore\\\\pdffile\\\\7d62eed3de32f05711820c16bc2bd670.pdf\",\"priority\":7,\"score\":0.0,\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"tokenNum\":2989,\"uriPath\":\"\"},{\"createTime\":\"2025-11-10T14:56:32.823\",\"description\":\"\",\"docName\":\"\",\"editTime\":\"2025-11-10T14:58:17.612\",\"fileName\":\"British-Food-Culture.doc\",\"folder\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\XiaoXinPro 16 IAH\\\\Desktop\\\\LRIA_llm_eval\\\\eval\\\\Quantum_e2e_v20251106\\\\Bvt1110\\\\bvtfiles\",\"id\":1987776371925061632,\"isDeleted\":0,\"isTmpFile\":false,\"labelNameList\":[],\"lastModifyTime\":\"2025-09-17T09:45:00\",\"md5\":\"435798f1c3377c7f5b71e18d733ca579\",\"path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\XiaoXinPro 16 IAH\\\\Desktop\\\\LRIA_llm_eval\\\\eval\\\\Quantum_e2e_v20251106\\\\Bvt1110\\\\bvtfiles\\\\British-Food-Culture.doc\",\"priority\":8,\"score\":0.0,\"status\":\"RUNNING\",\"tokenNum\":0,\"uriPath\":\"\"},{\"createTime\":\"2025-11-10T14:56:32.847\",\"description\":\"\",\"docName\":\"\",\"editTime\":\"2025-11-10T14:56:32.847\",\"errorDescription\":\"\",\"fileName\":\"Netflix Becomes a Broadway Producer With Peter Morgan’s Patriots.txt\",\"folder\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\XiaoXinPro 16 IAH\\\\Desktop\\\\LRIA_llm_eval\\\\eval\\\\Quantum_e2e_v20251106\\\\Bvt1110\\\\bvtfiles\",\"id\":1987776372025724928,\"isDel